# senate_fetch.py caches every fetched electronic report page under
# annual/<uuid>.html (829 files, ~66MB as of the first full run). Unlike
# House's per-year index files (small, the crosswalk source, committed --
# see pipeline/raw/house-financial-disclosures/.gitignore), Senate eFD has
# no bulk index at all: search results are fetched fresh from the paginated
# API every run (senate_fetch.search() deliberately doesn't cache them), so
# there's nothing here that's a source of truth rather than a re-derivable
# cache. Not committed, to keep the repo from ballooning with re-fetchable
# HTML the same way House's bulk PDF cache is excluded.
annual/
paper/
